WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.070
Are the powers of the Nikyu Nikyu Fruit the
most OP in One Piece? We break down the Paw

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.070
Paw Fruit and its user, Kuma, and uncover
his tragic past. Then, we explore the shocking

00:00:02.070 --> 00:00:03.070
reveal of Stussy, the clone of a former Rocks
crew member, and the implications of her vampire

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:04.070
Zoan Devil Fruit. Could Sanji's father, Judge,
have made her in an attempt to create the

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.070
perfect kid soldiers? Find out in our latest
breakdown of One Piece!

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.070
**Hook 2**

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.070
The One Piece manga just showed us the amazing
true powers of the Paw Paw Fruit. It might

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.420
be the strongest Devil Fruit in the story
and it could even give its user the ability

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:15.330
to copy other Devil Fruit powers. After eating
it, the user can repel anything they touch.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:19.360
Not only that, but it's one of the few Devil
Fruits that changes the user's appearance

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:24.420
permanently. They get paws on the palms of
their hands, which help them repel anything

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.260
they come in contact with.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:30.789
And I mean anything: We've seen it used for
some incredible things. It can be used to

00:00:30.789 --> 00:00:35.950
teleport people, protect them from powerful
attacks, and and in maybe the most famous

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:41.040
scene of One Piece, it is used to expel all
of Luffy's pain from his body, which Zoro

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:46.410
then takes on in his stead. And now, Eiichiro
Oda, the author of One Piece, has finally

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:52.840
fully explained how its powers work. Instead
of just being able to repel any physical object,

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:57.980
like a sword or a person, the Paw Paw Fruit
additionally also has the special ability

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:03.790
to repel IN-tangible things as well, like
it did with Luffy's pain. Pretty cool, right?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:08.369
That means that you can also use this fruit
to expel all KINDS of things. It can remove

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:14.360
memories, feelings, and thoughts from someone's
body and turn them into something you can

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:19.360
touch. This is usually in the form of a big
bubble that looks like a paw. For example,

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:24.541
Zoro stepped into this one containing luffy’s
pain. And in this new manga chapter, there

00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:30.430
is a sphere containing someone’s entire
memories. This fruit is so powerful--you can

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:35.790
repel anyone, no matter how strong they are,
and travel incredibly fast to wherever you

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:41.570
want. It can also push out someone's emotions
or pain and then use it on someone else or

00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:45.799
store it somewhere. But the best part is,
this fruit can do even more than what we know

00:01:45.799 --> 00:01:51.149
so far. In this chapter, we find out that
Bartholomew Kuma, who ate the Paw Paw Fruit,

00:01:51.149 --> 00:01:55.909
was not only Vegapunk’s test subject for
the pacifista and the seraphim, super advanced

00:01:55.909 --> 00:02:00.799
clone soldiers developed for the world government,
but Vegapunk used Kuma’s special devil fruit

00:02:00.799 --> 00:02:03.730
ability to do all sorts of other experiments
too.

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:08.670
And being able to take something invisible
like imagination and turn it into a real thing,

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:14.850
sounds a lot like Vegapunk's theory about
how Devil Fruits are made. Supposedly, they

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:19.910
are created out of people's imaginations.
So it's possible that Vegapunk may have used

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:25.450
Kuma's Devil Fruit power for his experiments
with Devil Fruits. The best evidence for this

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:30.490
are actually this elephant, this racoon and
this dog. Because none of them are real animals,

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:35.680
but objects that have eaten a Devil Fruit—a
sword that ate an Elephant Devil Fruit, a

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:40.709
teapot that ate a Raccoon Fruit, and a cannon
that can become a dog. We know that this new

00:02:40.709 --> 00:02:46.940
technology was created by Vegapunk, but how
can an object eat a Devil Fruit? Well according

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:52.950
to this new explanation of Kuma’s abilities,
it should be possible to push out the intangible

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:59.040
power of a Devil Fruit and put it into a new
object. so you take the elephant fruit, have

00:02:59.040 --> 00:03:04.870
Kuma extract the power inside and place a
sword inside the sphere. So you take the Elephant

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:09.330
Fruit, have Kuma take out the power inside,
which would look like one of his paw shaped

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:15.790
spheres, and put the sword inside the sphere.
So just how Zoro could absorb Luffy’s pain,

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:21.599
the sword would absorb the devil fruit power.
If that's true, then there's no argument that

00:03:21.599 --> 00:03:26.519
the Paw Paw Fruit is the best Devil Fruit
in One Piece. But we didn’t only learn a

00:03:26.519 --> 00:03:32.510
lot about this devil fruit in chapter 1072
- we also learned a lot of new things about

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:33.510
its user.

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:36.900
Now in case you don’t know for whatever
reason, Bartholomew Kuma is not only the person

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:41.650
who ate the Paw Paw fruit, but he also has
been one of the most mysterious and influential

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:46.620
characters in the entire story for Luffy and
the straw hats. He has gone full circle from

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:51.870
one of the most terrifying enemies of the
straw hats, to one of their biggest allies

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.040
and protectors. Here’s a quick recap:

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:59.329
The straw hats first met Kuma in chapter 483,
after they just barely beat the ancient giant

00:03:59.329 --> 00:04:03.470
oars, who had been transformed into a zombie
by Gekko Moria, one of the seven warlords

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:08.090
of the sea, who worked for the world government.
Luffy was still knocked out from the fight

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:12.340
and the straw hats were all tired from the
battle, when Kuma suddenly showed up on the

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:16.590
island. It turned out that he was another
warlord of the sea, who had been instructed

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:22.090
by the government to kill anyone who saw Moria's
defeat. In order to protect Luffy, Zoro and

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:27.310
Sanji offered themselves as sacrifice. This
led to my favorite scene of One Piece, where

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:33.610
Zoro took on all of Luffy's pain in exchange
for his freedom. We also found out that Kuma

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:38.330
was actually a person who was turned into
a cyborg by Dr. Vegapunk, which was a great

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:43.150
hint to what happened on Egghead Island and
Vegapunk telling us the truth about Kuma in

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.360
chapter 1072.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:49.110
A short time after their first encounter,
the straw hats run into Kuma again, during

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:53.800
the sabaody archipelago arc. After punching
one of the celestial Dragons, the highest

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:58.750
crime a person can commit in the One Piece
world, Kuma arrives together with admiral

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:03.630
Kizaru and Sentomaru, again mirroring the
current events in the story. And while Kizaru

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:09.479
is kept busy by Rayleigh, the Straw hats are
absolutely decimated by Kuma, as Luffy has

00:05:09.479 --> 00:05:14.699
to witness every last of his crew mates vanish
before his eyes. At this point in the story,

00:05:14.699 --> 00:05:20.569
it really seems like Kuma is the worst enemy
the crew ever had to face.

00:05:20.569 --> 00:05:25.539
After their major loss at Sabaody, the truth
about Kuma slowly came to light. It turned

00:05:25.539 --> 00:05:31.259
out that Kuma was trying to protect the Straw
Hat Pirates from Admiral Kizaru by sending

00:05:31.259 --> 00:05:36.419
each of them to the ideal place to improve
their abilities during the time skip. He had

00:05:36.419 --> 00:05:40.630
lost much of his free will when he became
a cyborg weapon for the government, and that's

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:44.180
why he had attacked the Straw Hats on Thriller
Bark. Yet, he still retained enough of his

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:49.419
humanity to save them and later protect their
ship, the Thousand Sunny, while it lay unguarded

00:05:49.419 --> 00:05:52.210
in a Sabaody harbor during the time skip.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:56.600
Kuma wanted to help the straw hats because
he was one of the three founders of the revolutionary

00:05:56.600 --> 00:06:02.039
army, lead by Luffy's father, Dragon. Kuma
and Dragon are also friends with Vegapunk,

00:06:02.039 --> 00:06:06.229
so Kuma let the scientist experiment on him
and turn him into a weapon for the government.

00:06:06.229 --> 00:06:12.810
Although we still don't understand why this
is the case. With his daughter Bonney about

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:17.060
to step into his bubble of memories however,
it seems very likely that we will be getting

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:23.190
a tragic Kuma flashback in the next chapters,
that will answer a lot of our questions. Make

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:26.970
sure to subscribe to the channel, if you don’t
want to miss the breakdown of that.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:33.080
Before he became a cyborg or joined the revolutionary
army, Kuma was actually the king of a country.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:38.650
Jinbei tells us, that Kuma got his title of
‘the tyrant’ for being a cruel ruler.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:44.460
However according to his daughter Bonney,
that is not true. And honestly, everything

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:49.370
we have seen of Kuma, including his flashback
with Vegapunk in chapter 1072, makes it look

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:55.570
like Kuma was actually a really good person
with a tragic past. We know that it’s tragic,

00:06:55.570 --> 00:07:00.169
because Vegapunk tell Bonney that he promised
Kuma not to tell her the truth about why he

00:07:00.169 --> 00:07:06.190
became a cyborg, because it would be too painful
for her to hear. So whatever it is, it sounds

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:11.300
like we should prepare a box of tissues once
we see what really happened to him. One thing

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:15.199
that we do know, is that Kuma is part of a
special race and that . And while it hasn’t

00:07:15.199 --> 00:07:19.900
been confirmed yet officially, it is very
likely, that Kuma is a member of the almost

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:25.759
extinct lunarian race. The only other known
member of this race is King, the right hand

00:07:25.759 --> 00:07:31.669
man of Kaido, who just like Kuma, was heavily
experimented on by the government. The lunarians

00:07:31.669 --> 00:07:36.580
were a race of winged humans, that lived on
top of the red line before the world government

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:42.080
was established, who were known as gods. They
have dark skin and are able to generate fire

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:47.580
from their bodies. And there are a few pieces
of evidence that kuma is a lunarian.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:52.340
He has the same dark skin as King. He was
used as the prototype for the Seraphim soldiers,

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:57.819
who all have Lunarian wings, fire and skin.
Luna means moon in Japanese, hinting at the

00:07:57.819 --> 00:08:01.889
fact that the lunarians were the advanced
civilization that lived on the moon, that

00:08:01.889 --> 00:08:06.080
we saw in a cover story with Enel. If Kuma
was a lunarian, it would also explain why

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:11.129
Kuma hated the world government so much and
why he formed the revolutionary army with

00:08:11.129 --> 00:08:16.900
Dragon, just how king joined the dragon Kaido.
In addition to that, just like the other warloards,

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:23.150
KUma has an animal theme. Kuma in Japanese
literally means bear. And as one really smart

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:27.520
reddit user noticed, the Asian black bear
in Japanese is called ツキノワグマ tsukinowaguma,

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:33.289
which literally means "**ring-of-the-moon**&nbsp;bear".
Apparently this is also the inspiration for

00:08:33.289 --> 00:08:39.010
the pokemon Teddiursa which has a crescent
moon, Ursaring who has a new moon, and Ursaluna

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:45.830
which has a full moon on his head.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:53.470
And as Vegapunk is arguing with Bonny about
Kuma, we actually see the real Kuma in chapter

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:58.940
1072, who has teleported himself to the foot
of the red line, trying to climb to the top.

00:08:58.940 --> 00:09:03.600
He is shot down by marine soldiers, but he
seems determined to reach his goal, whatever

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:08.160
that might be. Hopefully we will get the flashback
for Kuma soon.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:14.390
But there was obviously another major reveal
in this chapter that we have to talk about:

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:20.180
Stussy of the CP0 agency has just betrayed
Lucci and Kaku. AND it is revealed that she

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:25.980
is a clone of a former Rocks crew member.
The very first successful clone made by Vegapunk’s

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:32.510
team of crazy scientists. AND Stussy seems
to have what looks like a vampire zoan devil

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:38.680
fruit, that just looks absolutely badass.
And all this has opened up even more questions

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:44.010
we need answers to: For example, is Stussy
the secret female member of Vegapunk’s MADS

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:48.920
science group that we saw in the cover the
other chapter? Or was it maybe the original

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:54.821
stussy that got cloned? We know for a fact
that as the clone of a rocks pirate, Stussy

00:09:54.821 --> 00:10:01.390
must be incredibly strong. But then, why didn’t
Sanji’s father recognize her during the

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:06.839
wedding ceremony? They were sitting at the
same table. The next question is: Is stussy

00:10:06.839 --> 00:10:12.279
the mysterious person, that Vegapunk contacted
to help them? Because she sure did help by

00:10:12.279 --> 00:10:18.920
knocking out Kaku, but then again there could
still be someone else. Also, if stussy is

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:25.321
a perfect clone, that actually begs the question
who else in the story could be a clone. Anyone

00:10:25.321 --> 00:10:31.290
could be really. Maybe Luffy is a clone too.
Who knows with Oda. Then we have to ask: Where

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:36.120
is that original stussy of the rocks pirates
now? It seems like the correct answer seems

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:43.410
to be this stunningly beautiful lady here,
the mother of Edward Weevil. Her name is Bucking.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:49.149
While Stussy is introduced as the clone of
Miss Buckingham stussy. The name seems to

00:10:49.149 --> 00:10:54.120
match. Also, Bucking claims that her son is
the biological son of whitebeard, which would

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:59.139
make sense if they were in the same pirate
crew. And while she doesn’t look it now,

00:10:59.139 --> 00:11:05.139
if she looked the same as stussy does in her
youth, I could absolutely see Whitebeard going

00:11:05.139 --> 00:11:11.010
for her. Weevil is a very interesting case
anyways. He could be a clone too, after all

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:16.529
he has those stitch marks that Franky has
too. Or he could be Whitebeard’s actual

00:11:16.529 --> 00:11:22.940
son. During his introduction, Kizaru comments
that he definitely has the same power as a

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.470
young whitebeard.

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:30.180
So now we have two versions of a rocks crew
member. One seems to be on Vegapunks side,

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:35.040
who made her in the first place. While the
original seems to be working with the government.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:39.899
I love how this entire situation suddenly
got super intriguing. And there is actually

00:11:39.899 --> 00:11:44.250
one MORE thing i want to talk about with stussy
that one of the awesome members of my subreddit

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:49.820
brought to my attention. Have you ever realized
that she looks very very similar to Sanji’s

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:56.640
mother? same eyes, same hair, but shorter,
same lips. Stussy was cloned by the mads science

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:04.389
group. And Sanji’s father judge was a member.
Could judge have made another version of Stussy

00:12:04.389 --> 00:12:10.139
for himself, to create his perfect kid soldiers
with the DNA of a former rocks member? It

00:12:10.139 --> 00:12:15.529
is also interesting that Queen hates Judge
so much, which he reveals to Sanji during

00:12:15.529 --> 00:12:21.550
their fight. After all they were crew mates.
And we also know that Queen deals really poorly

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:26.580
with being rejected by women. It happens with
both Hiyori and one of the Geisha’s during

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:31.880
the fight with Sanji, who saves her life.
Could it be that Queen hates Judge for having

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:37.160
married a version of Stussy, a woman that
he fell in love with? Who was part of their

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.160
crew as well?

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:42.810
As I said more questions than answers. Instead,
let’s talk about Garp setting out to fight

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:47.120
blackbeard. If you havent heard my thoughts
on the crazy last chapter, then make sure

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:50.790
to check out that discussion right here. Thanks
for watching.

